% A blank node in a program is a labeled null of its own: every mention
% of one label is the same null, two labels are two nulls.

knows(alice, _:someone) .
knows(bob, _:someone) .
likes(_:someone, _:other) .

common(?x, ?y) :- knows(?x, ?z), knows(?y, ?z), ?x != ?y .
nulls(?z) :- knows(_, ?z) .
nulls(?z) :- likes(?z, _) .
nulls(?z) :- likes(_, ?z) .
